ver opponents in dynamic arenas. With no buttons for movement, every action relies on physical arm motions, making battles feel immersive and skill-based. Whether dodging attacks or launching strategic ambushes, players must rely on agility and reflexes to dominate.", "short_description": "Chimp Lab PVP is a fast-paced VR multiplayer game focused on PvP combat using Another Axiom\u2019s gorilla locomotion. Players must climb, jump, and maneuver skillfully to outplay opponents in intense battles."}]}, "developer_name": "Nebula Forge Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hXJ_DhZ3l-sa8h7vlkGD_xyDsg2eHFWFe9WXvkRpJ74/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Nebula Forge Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/chimp-lab-pvp/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "28919865314325820"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "28929419366703748", "version": "3.4.0"}, "id": "929673749242741", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"n